    },
    "interpretation": "The negative Overlap value (-2.0) represents the multiplicative interaction adjustment. Under removal_lift with log-link, this is expected behavior: it ensures the sum of individual channel contributions plus controls plus base plus overlap equals the total model prediction, without double-counting synergistic effects."
  }
}
```

